":"last:o:56a7d7b256b2","label":"n.","definitionZh":"最近的人","glossesEn":["previous or most recent person"],"examples":[{"english":"the night/week before last","chinese":"前天晚上/上上周"},{"english":"his new novel is better than the last","chinese":"他的新小说比上一本要好"},{"english":"the last we heard of him, he was living in Spain","chinese":"我们最近听到的消息是他住在西班牙"}]},{"id":"last:o:f9eaf03b9421","label":"n.","definitionZh":"最近的事物","glossesEn":["previous or most recent thing"]},{"id":"last:o:efd02ae846c6","label":"n.","definitionZh":"（某物中）仅剩的部分；这是我们仅剩的一些苹果；她把剩下的牛奶给猫喝了","glossesEn":["all that remains"],"examples":[{"english":"the last (of sth)","chinese":"（某物中）仅剩的部分"},{"english":"these are the last of our apples","chinese":"这是我们仅剩的一些苹果"},{"english":"she gave the cat the last of the milk","chinese":"她把剩下的牛奶给猫喝了"}]},{"id":"last:o:4f787f4d0e74","label":"n.","definitionZh":"最不可能的人","glossesEn":["least likely person"],"examples":[{"english":"he'd be the last to refuse an offer like that!","chinese":"他绝不可能拒绝那样的提议！"}]},{"id":"last:o:59dcd267d7a8","label":"n.","definitionZh":"最不可能的事物","glossesEn":["least likely thing"]},{"id":"last:o:9e6306aabf6f","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"在最后","glossesEn":["in final position"],"examples":[{"english":"he came last and left first","chinese":"他来得最晚，走得最早"},{"english":"do this last of all","chinese":"最后做这个"},{"english":"last, I'd like to thank you all for coming","chinese":"最后，我想感谢各位的光临"}]},{"id":"last:o:9c73bcd9b045","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"最后","glossesEn":["finally"]},{"id":"last:o:e937644a6434","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"最近","glossesEn":["most recently"],"examples":[{"english":"when did you see her last?","chinese":"你最近什么时候见过她？"},{"english":"I washed up last","chinese":"上一次是我洗的碗"},{"english":"last in, first out","chinese":"后来者先走"}]},{"id":"last:o:e3ebc5b100ef","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"最末","glossesEn":["in competition"],"examples":[{"english":"to rank last","chinese":"名列末位"}]},{"id":"last:o:3e5db4b9dc65","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"持续","glos