 spin cotton into thread","chinese":"把棉花纺成线"},{"english":"to spin wool from goat's hair","chinese":"用山羊毛纺毛线"},{"english":"hair like spun gold","chinese":"金丝般的毛发"}]},{"id":"spin:o:189073c1a6c3","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"结","domains":["Zoology"],"contexts":["web","cocoon"]},{"id":"spin:o:dbb977de73f4","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"甩干","glossesEn":["wring out"],"contexts":["washing"]},{"id":"spin:o:bd7849ed133d","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"编造","glossesEn":["tell"],"registers":["figurative"],"examples":[{"english":"to spin (sb) a yarn or tale (about sb/sth)","chinese":"编造（关于某人/某事物的）故事（给某人听）"}]},{"id":"spin:o:2e34e4c2b448","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"有倾向性地发布","glossesEn":["give bias to"],"registers":["informal"],"contexts":["news story"]},{"id":"spin:o:696654db2059","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"快速旋转","glossesEn":["rotate"],"examples":[{"english":"she spun on her heel and left","chinese":"她猛地转身走开了"},{"english":"to spin on one's toes","chinese":"踮着脚转圈"},{"english":"to go spinning","chinese":"旋转起来"}]},{"id":"spin:o:3b601371c2de","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"纺线","glossesEn":["draw out threads"]},{"id":"spin:o:de7529401351","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"用旋式诱饵钓鱼","domains":["Fishing"]},{"id":"spin:o:22f16d34ddfa","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"疾驰","glossesEn":["move along rapidly"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"to spin along or down the road on one's bike","chinese":"骑车在路上飞驰"}]},{"id":"spin:o:76f25aa528a9","label":"n.","definitionZh":"高速旋转","glossesEn":["rapid turn, turning motion"],"examples":[{"english":"to do or perform a spin","chinese":"做旋转动作"},{"english":"he did a spin on the ice","chinese":"他在冰上做了一个旋转动作"},{"english":"the spin of the earth as it goes round the sun","chinese":"地球绕太阳公转同时的自转"}]},{"id":"spin:o:cc51004ef819","label":"n.","definitionZh":"尾旋","domains":["Aviation"],"examples":[{"english":"to go or get into a spin","chinese":"进入尾旋；使飞机进入尾旋"},{"english":"to come or get out of a spin","chinese":"改出尾旋"}]},{"id":"spin:o:73aa38715031","labe