8f1f","label":"pron.","definitionZh":"什么时候","glossesEn":["what time"],"examples":[{"english":"by when?","chinese":"到什么时候？"},{"english":"from when until when?","chinese":"从什么时候到什么时候？"},{"english":"since when?","chinese":"从什么时候开始？；何曾？"}]},{"id":"when:o:747a503f2333","label":"pron.","definitionZh":"…的时候","glossesEn":["the time that"],"examples":[{"english":"that was when it all went wrong","chinese":"那时一切都乱了套"},{"english":"that's when I was born","chinese":"那是我出生的那天；那是我出生的那年"},{"english":"now is when we must act","chinese":"我们现在必须行动了"}]},{"id":"when:o:00637382bd44","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"在…时","glossesEn":["at the time that"],"examples":[{"english":"when he got home","chinese":"他到家时"},{"english":"I was in the bath when the phone rang","chinese":"我洗澡时电话铃响了"},{"english":"to have an accident when driving home","chinese":"开车回家时出车祸"}]},{"id":"when:o:227b383028ca","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"在…期间","glossesEn":["during the time that"],"examples":[{"english":"when you're in your teens","chinese":"在你的少年时期"},{"english":"when sailing, always wear a life jacket","chinese":"驾帆船航行时一定要穿救生衣"}]},{"id":"when:o:aad27d0eec3d","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"一…（就）","glossesEn":["as soon as"],"examples":[{"english":"when he arrives, I'll tell him","chinese":"他一到我就会告诉他的"}]},{"id":"when:o:8c84a05b329d","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"刚…（就）","glossesEn":["just after which"],"examples":[{"english":"I had just sat down when he arrived","chinese":"我刚坐下来他就到了"}]},{"id":"when:o:2353555a17b6","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"在…之后","glossesEn":["after"],"examples":[{"english":"when completed, the centre will be the largest of its kind","chinese":"该中心竣工后将是同类中最大的"}]},{"id":"when:o:fadec211d4e0","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"从…以后","glossesEn":["once"],"examples":[{"english":"when you've been to Scotland, you'll want to go again","chinese":"去过苏格兰，还会想再去"}]},{"id":"when:o:07bedcf8710a","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"每当…时","glossesEn":["whenever"],"examples":[{"english":"when I sunbathe, I get 